        },
        {
          "id": "a11.d05.reading.b3",
          "en": "\"How old are you?\" \"I am thirty. And you?\" \"I am twenty-five.\"",
          "ru": "«Сколько тебе лет?» «Мне тридцать. А тебе?» «Мне двадцать пять.»",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/a11.d05.reading.b3.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
